    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A base struct for postprocessing tools which produce a field, which is typically written to the visualization file alongside the solution (e.g., vorticity, Q-criterion, mesh velocity, ...).</para>
<para>This field can either be defined with a DataPostprocessor (outputted at visualization nodes directly), or with a PostprocessorAtDofBase, in which case the field is described as the degrees of freedom of some finite element approximation (e.g., an L2 projection). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
